  "findings": [
    "The old braces <3.0.3 issue is already excluded by installed braces 3.0.3.",
    "controller 7.2.5 -> controller-cli 7.2.5 requests chokidar ^3.5.3 -> installed chokidar 3.6.0 requests braces ~3.0.2 -> installed braces 3.0.3.",
    "Actual CLI logs --watch passes the configured log directory plus /iobroker* to chokidar.watch. Chokidar 4 removes glob support and is outside the declared major range.",
    "Chokidar getDirParts invokes braces.expand for glob paths containing an opening brace. This narrows the route; it does not establish whole-product reachability or non-reachability.",
    "A blind major override is not a compatible security patch. Keeping controller 7.2.5 while changing its CLI watcher would require a deliberate reviewed backport/adaptation and regression tests. No such implementation was performed."
  ],
