  "recommendation": "Retain controller 7.2.5 and track as open. Do not use audit fix --force or an unreviewed fork. A focused controller-7 CLI watcher adaptation/backport can be evaluated separately with real filesystem create/append/rotate/rename, glob/filter, symlink and close/error regression tests plus regenerated lock/SBOM/audit/native evidence."
